/E (This internship was completed at INTER DECCAN SOLUTIONS, where I gained a strong foundation in Artificial Intelligence and Python programming. During the internship, I studied key AI concepts such as machine learning, natural language processing \(NLP\), computer vision, intelligent agents, and search algorithms. As part of the practical training, I developed a Campus Information Assistant project, which helped me apply the concepts learned in a real-world scenario. Overall, the internship enhanced my technical knowledge, problem-solving abilities, and AI development skills while providing valuable industry exposure.)
